          "notable"
        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "守护旧礼的人希望泰迈记住，至高王与诸王之间从来既有誓义也有争执。真正的传统不是假装过去完美，而是在分裂中仍寻找共同法度。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": [
          "sarnor"
        ],
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
