        ],
        "IdentityIds": null,
        "IsFemale": null,
        "IsClanLeader": null,
        "SkillMin": null
      },
      "Content": "车匠、养马人和农户知道贵族骑阵由谁供养。他们尊敬肯付工钱、保护道路的泰迈，也会怨恨为了仪仗征走最后一匹耕马的主人。"
    },
    {
      "Priority": 0,
      "When": {
        "HeroIds": null,
        "Cultures": null,
        "KingdomIds": null,
        "SettlementIds": null,
        "Roles": [
